  "sourceFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">gatě</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> September 2025 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <div class=\"text-center\"><p>Nosim tyhle kalhoty.<br>\nRoztrhly se.<br>\nZašil jsem je.<br>\nZas se roztrhly.<br>\nZas jsem je zašil.<br>\nTohle pořád opakuju.<br>\nA pořád je nosim.</p></div>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/gate-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/gate-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">gatě</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> September 2025 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <div class=\"text-center\"><p>\nI wear these pants.<br>\nThey ripped.<br>\nI sewed them up.<br>\nThey ripped again.<br>\nI sewed them up again.<br>\nI keep doing this over and over.<br>\nAnd I still wear them.</p></div>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/gate-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/gate-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure> </div> ",
